The use of Cornwall as a film location has led to the establishment of ventures based in the area, including the £6 million South West Film Studios at
St Agnes, now owned by Marilyn Gough, the Cornwall Film Fund, the Cornwall Film Festival, and the production company Mundic Nation.

22
